name: Erratic Eight Spike — many 8s
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 13 Eights, a 25% rank spike for 8 Ball,
  Even Steven, and X-of-a-kind hands. RAG aliases: erratic eights, many 8s, 8 Ball
  tarot farm, funny tarot vending machine, repeated eights.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticRank: Eight
    min: 13
should:
  - joker: EightBall
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 55
  - joker: EvenSteven
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    label: "Doubles 8 Ball's listed probability"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: TheFamily
    label: "Four/Five of a Kind payoff from Eight density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
